config AK_ETHERNET
	tristate "Anyka AK3918 (Aimer39) Ethernet support"
	depends on ARCH_AK && OF
	depends on MACH_AK3918
	help
	  The older Anyka 10/100 MAC of the AK3910/AK3916/AK3918 (Aimer39),
	  from the Aimer39 SDK. The module is ak_ethernet. EV200, EV300 and
	  EV330 have a Synopsys GMAC instead (AK_GMAC).
